#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:78
msgid ""
"An alternative is to use :ref:`vector_graphics`. Vector graphics, for "
"instance SVGs, employ mathematic formulae like splines and Bézier curves to "
"describe a shape. As they are mathematically defined, they can be resized to "
"suit your needs without losing resolution."
msgstr ""
"栅格图像的一种替代方案是 :ref:`vector_graphics` ，如 SVG 图像等。这种图像使用"
"如贝塞尔曲线等数学公式来定义形状，因此无论如何缩放，也不会影响最终的精度。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:83
msgid ""
"SeExpr belongs to a different class, *procedural graphics*. Similar to "
"vector graphics, procedural graphics only need a few KBs of secondary "
"storage for their definition. But they are not defined by mathematical "
"formulae; you actually *code* how the color is calculated at each point of "
"the texture. And, because it is not limited in its precision, you can render "
"complex patterns in your layers at completely arbitrary resolution."
msgstr ""
"SeExpr 是一种 **程序化图形** 生成器，它和前两者是完全不同的类型。 SeExpr 图像"
"脚本的二次存储体积与矢量图形一样很小，只有几 KB，但和矢量图形不同，这些脚本并"
"非数学公式。你可以对 SeExpr 的脚本进行 **编程** ，指定纹理的任意一点的着色方"
"法。SeExpr 生成的图像没有精度限制，你可以在任意分辨率下为填充图层输出复杂的图"
"案。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:92
msgid "Writing a script"
msgstr "如何编写 SeExpr 脚本"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:94
msgid ""
"In this tutorial, we'll show you how to write a script in SeExpr, render it "
"to a layer, and then save it as a preset."
msgstr ""
"在接下来的实例教程中，我们将向你展示如何使用 SeExpr 编写脚本，将结果输出到填"
"充图层，并将它保存为 SeExpr 脚本预设。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:97
msgid ""
"We'll start by going to the :ref:`layer_docker`, and adding a new Fill "
"Layer. Then select the SeExpr generator from the list. You'll be greeted by "
"this window:"
msgstr ""
"首先前往 :ref:`layer_docker` 面板，添加一个填充图层。在对话框中的列表中选择 "
"SeExpr，如下图所示："

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:103
msgid ""
"The SeExpr generator dialog is divided into two tabs. For now, we'll stay "
"on :guilabel:`Options`."
msgstr "SeExpr 页面有两个标签页。我们先关注 :guilabel:`脚本选项` 标签页。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:107
msgid ":ref:`fill_layers` describes these tabs in more detail."
msgstr ""
"要进一步了解 SeExpr 两个标签页的具体功能，可在 :ref:`fill_layers` 的页面点击 "
"SeExpr 查看。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:109
msgid "Let's start by painting a layer in light blue."
msgstr "现在先让我们把图层填充成浅蓝色。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:111
msgid ""
"First, SeExpr scripts must define an output variable, let's call it "
"``$color``. As SeExpr thinks of colors in the :ref:`RGB color "
"space<model_rgb>`, color variables are defined by a triplet of numbers known "
"as a *vector*. We'll start by defining the ``$color`` variable and giving it "
"a value."
msgstr ""
"SeExpr 脚本必须定义输出变量，因为我们要填充颜色，因此我们需要呼叫 ``$color`` "
"变量。SeExpr 在 :ref:`RGB 色彩空间<model_rgb>` 中定义颜色，每种颜色以三个一组"
"的数值进行定义，它们被称作 **颜色矢量** 。下面我们将要给 ``$color`` 变量赋"
"值。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:116
msgid ""
"Go to the text box, and clear it if it has any text. Then, define and set "
"``$color`` to something like ``[0.5, 0.5, 1]`` (half lit red, half lit "
"green, fully lit blue)::"
msgstr ""
"前往对话框底部的文本框，清除所有已有文本，然后重新编写脚本。让我们给 "
"``$color`` 变量赋予数值 ``[0.5, 0.5, 1]`` (50% 红、50% 绿、100% 蓝)::"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:120
msgid "$color = [0.5, 0.5, 1];"
msgstr "$color = [0.5, 0.5, 1];"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:122
msgid ""
"SeExpr needs to know which variable holds the final color value. This is "
"done by writing at the end, on its own line, the name of the variable::"
msgstr ""
"SeExpr 必须知道哪个变量输出最终颜色数值，因此我们要在脚本的末尾添加该变量的名"
"称::"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:125
msgid "$color"
msgstr "$color"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:127
msgid "The script should now look like this::"
msgstr "本例子的完整脚本如下所示::"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:129
msgid ""
"$color = [0.5, 0.5, 1];\n"
"$color"
msgstr ""
"$color = [0.5, 0.5, 1];\n"
"$color"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:132
msgid "Click :guilabel:`OK`, and you'll render your first script!"
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`确定` ，该脚本的效果将输出到填充图层，如下图所示："

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:137
msgid ""
"To be absolutely precise, SeExpr **has no color management**. It always "
"renders textures as :ref:`32-bit float <bit_depth>`, :ref:`gamma corrected "
"<linear_and_gamma>`, sRGB images. Krita transforms them into your document's "
"color space using the sRGB-elle-V2-srgbtrc.icc profile."
msgstr ""
"SeExpr 本身 **不进行色彩管理** ，它总是按照 :ref:`32 位浮点 <bit_depth>` ， :"
"ref:`gamma 校正亮度 <linear_and_gamma>` ，sRGB 色彩空间进行颜色计算。Krita 会"
"按照 sRGB-elle-V2-srgbtrc.icc 特性文件把 SeExpr 输出的图像数据转换到工作图像"
"的色彩空间。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:143
msgid "See :ref:`color_managed_workflow` for what this means."
msgstr ""
"如果你不知道什么是色彩管理，请参考 :ref:`color_managed_workflow` 的介绍。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:147
msgid "Managing your script using widgets"
msgstr "通过对话框控件修改脚本"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:149
msgid ""
"There is also another way to define and edit your variables. Open the fill "
"layer's properties by right-clicking on :guilabel:`Fill Layer 1`, and "
"selecting :guilabel:`Layer Properties...`."
msgstr ""
"除了直接编写脚本外，你还可以通过图形界面对脚本的变量进行编辑。在之前建立的浅"
"蓝色填充图层 :guilabel:`Fill Layer 1` 上面点击右键，选择 :guilabel:`图层属性…"
"` 打开填充图层对话框。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:154
msgid ".. image:: images/seexpr/SeExpr_prop_1.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/seexpr/SeExpr_prop_1.png"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:155
msgid ""
"Notice the middle box? Once it detects a syntactically correct script, "
"SeExpr enables a whole chunk of knobs to manage individual variables. In our "
"example above, you can change ``$color``'s in three ways:"
msgstr ""
"注意对话框中间一栏：只要脚本的语法正确，那里就会显示相关的控件，让你可以通过"
"图形界面编辑每个变量。在上图所示的例子中，你可以通过 3 种方式更改 ``$color`` "
"变量："

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:159
msgid "enter the red, green, or blue channel's value in the input fields"
msgstr "在红、绿、蓝数值框中直接输入颜色数值。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:160
msgid "move the little colored sliders to change the respective channel"
msgstr "拖动每个颜色通道下方的滑动条。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:161
msgid ""
"click on the preview square to the left of the boxes, to select a completely "
"new color."
msgstr ""
"点击颜色通道左边的预览色块，这将弹出拾色器对话框，你可以用它直接选取一种颜"
"色。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:163
msgid ""
"The last button on the middle box is always :guilabel:`Add new variable`. "
"Click it and this dialog will open:"
msgstr ""
"中间栏右下角显示了一个 :guilabel:`新增变量 (Add new variable)` 按钮，点击后将"
"弹出下面的对话框："

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:167
msgid ".. image:: images/seexpr/SeExpr_add_variable.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/seexpr/SeExpr_add_variable.png"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:168
msgid "This dialog shows you all the types of variables that SeExpr accepts:"
msgstr "这个对话框列出了 SeExpr 支持的所有变量类型："

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:171
msgid "Curve and Color curve"
msgstr "Curve 和 Color curve"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:173
msgid ""
"They are the SeExpr version of :ref:`Stop Gradients <resource_gradients>`: "
"they interpolate a ramp given by a set of values."
msgstr ""
"Curve (曲线) 和 Color Curve (颜色曲线) 变量相当于 SeExpr 的 :ref:`色标渐变 "
"<resource_gradients>` ：它们对一组数值定义的颜色梯度进行插值处理。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:175
msgid ""
"Curves represent 1D gradients, returning a single float at each evaluation "
"point."
msgstr ""
"Curve 变量对应的是 1 维 (单色) 渐变，它为每个估值点返回一个单精度浮点数据。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:177
msgid "Color curves represent RGB gradients, returning a Color at each point."
msgstr ""
"Color curve 变量对应的是 RGB 颜色渐变，它为每个估值点返回一组颜色矢量。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:178
msgid "Integers and Floats"
msgstr "Integers 和 Floats"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:180
msgid "Numbers."
msgstr "Int ( Integer/整数) 和 Float (浮点) 是数值。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:181
msgid "Vector"
msgstr "Vector"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:183
msgid "A triplet of floats."
msgstr "Vector (矢量) 是三个一组的浮点数据。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:184
msgid "Color"
msgstr "Color"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:186
msgid "A vector representing an RGB color."
msgstr "Color (颜色矢量) 是代表了一种 RGB 颜色的矢量。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:187
msgid "Swatch"
msgstr "Swatch"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:189
msgid "A list of Colors."
msgstr "Swatch (颜色样本) 变量包含了一系列的颜色。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:190
msgid "String"
msgstr "String"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:192
msgid "Usually single words."
msgstr "String (字串) 通常用来指定一个单词。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:194
msgid ""
"For instance, you could replicate ``$color`` in the :guilabel:`Vector` tab:"
msgstr ""
"例如，你可以在 :guilabel:`Vector` 标签页中指定和前面 ``$color`` 变量中使用过"
"的颜色矢量："

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:197
msgid ".. image:: images/seexpr/SeExpr_add_variable_vector.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/seexpr/SeExpr_add_variable_vector.png"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:200
msgid "Creating your first preset"
msgstr "制作 SeExpr 脚本预设"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:202
msgid "Once your script is ready, you can reuse it by making a preset."
msgstr "你可以将制作好的 SeExpr 脚本保存成预设，这样就可以在日后重复使用它了。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:204
msgid "You can create one through the top bar of the :guilabel:`Options` tab:"
msgstr "要将当前 SeExpr 脚本保存为新预设，请前往 :guilabel:`选项` 标签页："

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:208
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`Save New SeExpr Preset...` and the following dialog will "
"open:"
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`保存新的 SeExpr 预设…` 按钮，打开下面的对话框："

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:213
msgid ""
"You can edit the name of the preset in the top line edit box, and set a  "
"thumbnail for easy identification."
msgstr ""
"在对话框的顶部输入框可以更改脚本预设的名称，在右栏按钮可以指定一个易于分辨的"
"缩略图。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:215
msgid ""
"The dialog will append \"Copy\" to the preset's name if it is a copy of an "
"existing one. You can change it at will."
msgstr ""
"如果该预设是已有脚本的副本，它的名字后面将带有 Copy (副本) 字样。你也可以把它"
"改掉。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:217
msgid "The dialog provides the following choices for setting a thumbnail:"
msgstr "你可以使用对话框右栏的一系列按钮来为脚本预设指定缩略图："

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:220
msgid "Load Existing Thumbnail"
msgstr "加载已有缩略图"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:222
msgid ""
"If the preset already has a thumbnail (for instance, if you created it from "
"an existing preset), this button will load and apply it."
msgstr ""
"如果该脚本预设已经带有缩略图 (例如在它是从已有脚本预设复制得到的副本)，点击此"
"按钮即可加载该缩略图。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:223
msgid "Load Image"
msgstr "加载图像为缩略图"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:225
msgid "Applies an image from the filesystem as a thumbnail."
msgstr "从文件系统中指定一个图像文件用缩略图用作缩略图。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:226
msgid "Render Script to Thumbnail"
msgstr "将脚本效果渲染成缩略图"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:228
msgid ""
"Renders your script to a 256x256 texture, and applies the latter as a "
"thumbnail."
msgstr "将该脚本渲染成 256 x 256 的纹理，把它作为缩略图。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:229
msgid "Clear Thumbnail"
msgstr "清除缩略图"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:231
msgid ""
"Deletes the thumbnail. Note that, if the preset is a copy of an existing "
"one, this can be reverted by clicking :guilabel:`Load Existing Thumbnail`."
msgstr ""
"删除当前缩略图。如果该预设是已有预设的副本，你可以在删除后点击 :guilabel:`加"
"载已有缩略图` 按钮将它恢复。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:235
msgid "Changing existing presets"
msgstr "修改已有 SeExpr 预设"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:237
msgid ""
"If you change a preset's script, you will notice two new buttons in the top "
"bar of the :guilabel:`Options` tab:"
msgstr ""
"如果你对脚本预设进行了修改， :guilabel:`选项` 标签页右上角将显示两个小按钮："

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:241
msgid ""
"The reload button will restore the preset to its original properties, while "
"clicking on :guilabel:`Overwrite Preset` will save your changes."
msgstr ""
"点击“重新加载”按钮，脚本会被重置为它原本的状态。点击 :guilabel:`覆盖预设` 按"
"钮，当前设置将覆盖原脚本。"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:243
msgid ""
"Additionally, you can edit the preset's name by clicking on the rename "
"button, entering the new name, and clicking on :guilabel:`Save`:"
msgstr ""
"点击铅笔状的“编辑”按钮，即可编辑该脚本预设的名称，之后点击 :guilabel:`保存` "
"按钮即可完成重命名："

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:251
msgid "Bundling your presets"
msgstr "将 SeExpr 导出为资源包文件"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:253
msgid ""
"Sharing your scripts is easy! SeExpr script presets are just like any other "
"resource in Krita. Follow the instructions in :ref:`resource_management` to "
"create your own bundles."
msgstr ""
"你可以根据 :ref:`resource_management` 页面的指引导出任意 SeExpr 脚本为资源"
"包，与其他人分享。"
